      {
        "id": "textbook-model-definition",
        "moduleId": "implementation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "从零实现：状态初始化与前向计算",
        "markdown": "长短期记忆网络的隐状态需要额外返回一个记忆元，两者都初始化为形状（批量大小，隐藏单元数）的全零张量：\n\n```python\ndef init_lstm_state(batch_size, num_hiddens):\n    return zeros((batch_size, num_hiddens)), zeros((batch_size, num_hiddens))\n```\n\n前向计算在每个时间步依次求三个门和候选记忆元，再更新记忆元与隐状态：\n\n```python\nI = sigmoid(X @ W_xi + H @ W_hi + b_i)\nF = sigmoid(X @ W_xf + H @ W_hf + b_f)\nO = sigmoid(X @ W_xo + H @ W_ho + b_o)\nC_tilda = tanh(X @ W_xc + H @ W_hc + b_c)\nC = F * C + I * C_tilda\nH = O * tanh(C)\nY = H @ W_hq + b_q\n```\n\n注意，只有隐状态会传递到输出层，而记忆元 $\\mathbf{C}_t$ 不直接参与输出计算。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
